From 7cdb0465e633e468c089a5782ed728e3b661fd6f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 03:05:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 09/10] Seer: more ways to download, with automatic fallback

YouTube now searches YouTube Music before YouTube, scores the results
against the request, and tries the best three with three yt-dlp player
clients, dropping downloads that hang. SoundCloud is a new source. Albums
no source could get are built track by track from the tracklist.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

